  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Political economy analysis on migration in Tunisia to inform policy and programing processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The objective of this migration analysis is to support the European Union&#xbf;s ongoing comprehensive approach to migration in relation to Tunisia. It aims to examine the structural, institutional, and actor-specific factors that shape the country&#xbf;s migration dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The analysis will delve into the political, economic, and social contexts of Tunisia&apos;s migration landscape, identifying key actors, interests, and power dynamics. The findings will contribute to inform both policy and programing processes in Tunisia and will provide input and entry points for the EU to rethink and address migration challenges in a more holistic, sustainable and effective manner.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
